## "tiers": [{"tier", "ilvl", "name", "mods": [{"stat","op","min","max"[,"min2","max2"][,"decimals"]}]}]}.
## OWNER: items. Used by ItemDB (preload); no class_name on purpose.
##
## Filters: an affix can roll on a base if base.slot_type is in "slot_types" AND (when "tags" is
